			"notes": "## ✨ What's New \n- Persist group settings (i.e. volumes) so you don't get jumpscared when someone queues a new song after time of silence (#3)\n- Show current volume and bassboost level in `/music now-playing`\n\n## 🐛  Bug Fixes \n- Updated lavaplayer and the YouTube source to fix issues related to playback.\n- Pad seconds in `/music now-playing`, so `1:2/3:43` -> `1:02/3:43`"
